<title>MALAYSIA: Antah Holdings stock suspended.</title>
<headline>Antah Holdings stock suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Antah Holdings Bhd's stock was suspended on Tuesday at the company's request, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Company officials could not immediately be reached for comment. Antah's shares closed at 3.38 ringgit on Monday.</p>
<p>The company is involved in property development, distribution of consumer products and other activities.</p>
</text>
